    "event": "pull_request",
    "head_branch": "claude/elegant-ritchie-5b81ka",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(formation): the loose and fleeing entries' keys live in the unit store\n\nSpec 35 step 2a (Decision 142). Every other key of a unit's loose and\nfleeing entries (next, goal, foe_at, touch, toward, stuck, closest; along,\ncaught, held_by, fanned) is a column of the GDScript store, with a KEYS\ncolumn saying which keys an entry holds (EntryKeys). squad.loose and\nsquad.fleeing map each unit's id to the unit, in the order the entry was\ngiven. A unit moved to another squad (FormationRecovery._join,\nFormationContact.reinforce, GroupSplit._group) now leaves no entry behind\nin its old one; the three digest sets are unchanged on both engines.\n\nPre-existing files modified beyond the OCP limit (44), under Decision 142's waiver.\n\nWaived-by: Decision 142\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KNhteRASKu7RPFwLaQZi26",
